/// Reorders a collection of items so that they appear in the sequence defined by a separate list of identifiers.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `items` - A vector of items, each containing an identifier accessible via a closure
/// * `id_order` - A slice of identifiers defining the desired order
/// * `get_id` - A closure that extracts the identifier from an item
///
/// # Returns
/// A new vector with items reordered according to `id_order`
///
