/// contains the row index and column-value pairs.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `df` - A Polars DataFrame to convert.
///
/// # Returns
/// A `Vec<HashMap<String, Value>>` where each `HashMap` represents a row with:
/// - `"index"`: The row index (as a `Value`).
/// - `"column_name"`: The value for that column (as a `Value`).
