/// Count how many times `word` occurs as a whole word in `text`.
///
/// - `case_sensitive`: when false, matching is case-insensitive (uses (?i)).
/// - Returns `Ok(count)` or `Err(fancy_regex::Error)` if matching fails.
/// - An empty `word` yields 0.
///
