/// Combines multiple lists into a single list by following a sequence that specifies
/// which input list to draw from at each step.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `lists` - A vector of vectors to combine
/// * `sequence` - A vector of indices specifying which list to draw from at each step
///
/// # Returns
/// A vector containing elements combined according to the sequence
///
/// # Panics
/// Panics if a sequence index is out of bounds or if a list runs out of elements
///
/// # Example
/// ```ignore
/// let lists = vec![
