/// - `rows()` -> number of rows,
/// - `cols()` -> number of columns,
/// - indexing by `(row, col)` returning the element (e.g. `mat[(r, c)]`),
/// - and `Mat::from_vec(rows, cols, data_vec)` to create a matrix from row-major data.
///
