/// Combines all elements of a list of integers into a single integer by
/// converting each to its digit sequence and concatenating them in order.
///
/// # Arguments
///
/// * `numbers` - A slice of integers to concatenate
///
/// # Returns
///
/// * `Option<u64>` - The concatenated integer, or None if the list is empty
///   or the result would overflow
///
/// # Examples
