/// Divide each value in the columns named in `columns_list0` by the corresponding
/// value in `column_name0` (row-wise) and write the results back into the same columns.
///
/// - df: mutable reference to the DataFrame to modify
/// - columns_list0: list of column names to be divided (target columns)
/// - column_name0: name of the column used as the divisor (source column)
///
/// Returns Err(...) if a requested column doesn't exist or an underlying operation fails.
